{{ArcaneBox}}
'''Theorem Contagion''' is an [[Arcane Enhancement]] for [[Warframes]] that grants them the ability to spawn orbiting globes upon contact with the area of effect caused by {{Arcane|Residual Boils}}, {{Arcane|Residual Malodor}}, {{Arcane|Residual Shock}}, or {{Arcane|Residual Viremia}}. These globes will target the closest enemy within 15 meters, dealing damage and increasing their vulnerability to the globe's damage type.

Can be sold for {{cc|1,000}}.

